{"sections":{"custom_code_cM6bYi":{"type":"custom-code","settings":{"custom_css":".template-page #MainContent {\npadding-bottom: 0;\n}"}},"main":{"type":"page-about-us","settings":{}},"custom-content":{"type":"custom-content","blocks":{"be5d2488-3c71-471f-bb75-dbccb6970cb0":{"type":"image","disabled":true,"settings":{"link":"","width":"100%","alignment":"center","block_custom_class":"","animations":"inherit"}},"f5e88f1f-ff68-4d03-b686-0cb9fe62fab1":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"<h4 class=\"about__block-heading\">We love what we do – discovering amazing new items to enhance your life!<\/h4>","subheading":"","text":"<p>Hey there! Welcome to Alley Cat Trading, your go-to Australian-owned online shop for affordable home decor and gifts you'll absolutely adore. We're a team with a passion for unique home decor that brings life to your surroundings. From industrial living and Hamptons chic to farmhouse, French styling, and scandustrial, we've got all the trendy styles you crave, and they won't break the bank. Whether you're looking to spruce up your space or just want to add something new to your collection, we hope you love our products as much as we love finding them for you. Based in the charming historic town of Warwick, Queensland, Australia, we invite you to dive into our collection and have a blast exploring!<\/p>","width":"75%","alignment":"center","align_text":"center","text_size":"medium","text_color":"black","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"sf__btn-primary","button_size":"","block_custom_class":"","animations":"inherit"}},"4e1fb14f-ef60-4693-b6a2-2b26063e1b70":{"type":"image","disabled":true,"settings":{"link":"","width":"50%","alignment":"center","block_custom_class":"","animations":"inherit"}},"9a3a8077-de29-4141-9162-b9484d4a85f8":{"type":"html","disabled":true,"settings":{"code":"<div class=\"sf__about-custom-list\">\n  <h3>We are proudly<br> Australian.<\/h3>\n  <ul>\n    <li>\n      <span><img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0561\/2742\/2636\/files\/icon1.svg?v=1627616411\"><\/span>\n      <div class=\"rte\">\n          <h4>Soft Fabric<\/h4>\n          <p class=\"text-color-subtext\">Get complimentary ground shipping on every<br> order.Don’t love it? Send it back, on us.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/li>\n    <li>\n      <span><img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0561\/2742\/2636\/files\/icon2_daf1b6c2-ef2e-416c-ae6a-a7ddd145b6c5.svg?v=1627616411\"><\/span>\n      <div class=\"rte\">\n          <h4>Lightweight<\/h4>\n          <p class=\"text-color-subtext\">Join Minimog Rewards to earn gift cards<br>\nand enjoy exclusive member benefits.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/li>\n    <li>\n      <span><img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0561\/2742\/2636\/files\/icon3.svg?v=1627616411\"><\/span>\n      <div class=\"rte\">\n          <h4>All Day Comfort<\/h4>\n          <p class=\"text-color-subtext\">We believe getting dressed should be the<br> easiest part of your day.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/li>\n  <\/ul>\n<\/div>","width":"50%","block_custom_class":"sf__about-custom-html","animations":"inherit"}},"28e3ce35-e364-43f3-ba87-18b633233063":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"<h4 class=\"about__block-heading\">How we got started!<\/h4>","subheading":"","text":"<p>Our story kicked off in 2019 when founder Justin got inspired by his family's love of collecting. They all had a knack for filling their spaces with their favorite things, and Justin wanted to spread that joy to everyone—so Alley Cat Trading was born. We love a bit of clutter! We believe every nook and cranny of your home should be bursting with the things you adore. Whether it's a quirky statue, a cute pot plant, a fragrant candle, or a fun tea towel, we want your space to be a reflection of who you are and what you love!<\/p>","width":"75%","alignment":"center","align_text":"center","text_size":"medium","text_color":"black","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"sf__btn-primary","button_s